{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國一個聯邦陪審團於周二裁定，中國科技巨頭華為技術有限公司在竊取商業秘密共謀及銀行欺詐方面罪名成立。該案涉及華為成長為全球最大無線電信設備供應商之一過程中的多項商業行為。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587880.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T21:24:20.164084+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T20:59:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T21:17:32.950009+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T21:17:32.950009+00:00","content_hash":"519c1c04100f25d63318843472479657be6c5f433a52ed7b0a896085d81754d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}